      "id": "claim_68b59aac840745c08a8360e1022dd4d0",
      "statement": "The Worker proxies all album images because the frame's Android 8.1 trust store lacks the root CA used by Apple's photo servers. The album is listed through the same anonymous CloudKit calls the public album web page makes: resolve the share token to obtain a short-lived publicAccessAuthToken and databasePartition, then page through CPLAssetAndMasterByAssetDateWithoutHiddenOrDeleted records in the shared zone.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://dashboard/worker/index.js#L73-L77",
