      "id": "claim_041ad679f53f496d8571963aff94a436",
      "statement": "toPhotos chooses one JPEG per asset (edited rendition on the asset, then the master's medium JPEG, then a JPEG original no larger than 2560 px), skips videos and HEIC-only originals, builds ids from the record name plus a 12-character file fingerprint, and caps the list at 500.",
